/*  EXPECTED: REJECTED at type-check, identically by both backends.

    Written to attack the store rules (2026-11-17 review): second name for an element. A rabbit's series reaches
    something that outlives the rabbit (docs/SOUNDNESS.md, obligation O2). */

Define table as a series of series of series of number.
Insert (a series of series of number) into table.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define row as item 1 of table.
    Define inner as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    Insert inner into row.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State table.
